      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سعْرٌ قَاطٌّ</span></b>  <i>A dear price;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَقْطُوطٌ</span></b> , (M,
K,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَطٌّ</span></b> , (K,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَاطِطٌ</span></b> . (IAar, K.)

You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَرَدْنَا أَرْضًا قَاطًّا سِعْرُهَا</span> <i>We arrived at a
land of dear prices.</i> (S, TA.)

